            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&lt;html&gt;An Ultra LowFat Diet restricts your consumption offat to under10% of daily calories.Generally,a low fat diet provides around 30% of its calories as fat.Studies reveal that this diet is foe weight loss in the long term."/>
