            </Property>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&lt;html&gt;AN ultra low fat diet contains 10% or fewer calories from fat.The diet is mostly plant basedand has a limited intake ofanimal products.Therfore it&apos;s generally very high in carbs-around 80% ofcalories-and low in proteins-at 10% of calories. "/>
          </Properties>
